      "s": "shuowen_jiezi",
      "t": "古食肉器也。从口，象形。凡豆之屬皆从豆。",
      "w": 1
    },
    {
      "s": "wiktionary",
      "t": "Pictogram (象形) – some kind of container. Borrowed phonetically for the plant name. Displaced Old Chinese 菽 (shū). Unrelated to the bottom part of 豊.\nDerived from 頭 (OC *doː), ultimately from Proto-Sino-Tibetan *du (“head”) (STEDT).\n\"Soybean > bean\" is possibly the same word as \"round vessel\" (Unger, 1984)"
    }
  ],
  "shuowen": "古食肉器也。从口，象形。凡豆之屬皆从豆。",
